  "sourceTitle": "Potato Au Gratin",
  "sourceText": "Potato Au Gratin\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Wednesday, December 23, 2009 - 12:58am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n6 potatoes, sliced thin\n1 can cheddar cheese soup\n1 sm. onion\n1 can + ½ c. milk\nShredded sharp cheddar cheese\nButter\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Layer sliced potatoes in buttered 2 quart casserole. Slice onion and add, mix milk and soup and add over all. Put butter and sharp cheese on top and bake at 375 degrees for 1 hour and 15 minutes.",
